    equal to the number of those targets in the GY, and if you do, attach those targets
    to this card. If this card is sent to the GY: You can target 1 face-up card on
    the field; negate its effects until the end of this turn. You can only use each
    effect of "Mereologic Aggregator" once per turn.'
